## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

A Third-Party Risk Assessment (TPRA) was conducted for AI-Draft Technologies Inc. prior to procurement by the Marketing department. The vendor's service involves processing internal customer communications and product roadmaps.

The assessment revealed **3 Critical security risks**, including lack of encryption at rest, absence of independent SOC 2/ISO certifications, and default LLM data training policies. **Procurement is blocked** until mandatory compensating controls are contractually agreed upon.

