## 3. MANDATORY REMEDIATION & COMPENSATING CONTROLS

To move from **REJECTED** to **CONDITIONALLY APPROVED**, AI-Draft must contractually sign and enforce the following requirements:

1. **Enterprise Opt-Out Agreement (LLM Training):**
    - *Mandate:* Sign a legally binding Data Processing Addendum (DPA) guaranteeing Zero Data Retention (ZDR) and total exclusion of company data from LLM model training.
2. **Mandatory Encryption at Rest:**
    - *Mandate:* Enforce AES-256 bit database encryption for all stored customer assets within **30 days**.
3. **Independent Third-Party Security Audit:**
    - *Mandate:* AI-Draft must provide a SOC 2 Type II report or initiate an ISO/IEC 27001 audit within **120 days**; interim approval requires a right-to-audit clause for our internal security team.
